  "id": "pca-90",
  "after": "selfCheck",
  "title": "How many PCA columns keep 90%?",
  "caption": "Made-up numbers. Each bar is the share of the spread one new column keeps; in code this list is explained_variance_ratio_. np.cumsum adds them up as a running total. The first total of 0.90 or more is at index 3, and Python counts from 0, so you need 4 columns.",
  "alt": "Five bars for PC1 to PC5 with shares 0.40, 0.30, 0.15, 0.10 and 0.05, and Python index 0 to 4 under them. A running total line goes 0.40, 0.70, 0.85, 0.95 and 1.00. A dashed line marks 90 percent. The first point above it, 0.95 at PC4, index 3, is highlighted. Text: first total of 0.90 or more is at index 3; Python counts from 0, so 3 + 1 = 4 columns.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 336\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"12\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Spread kept by each new column</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"30\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">share</text><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"108\" y2=\"35\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"99\" cy=\"35\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"f-ink\"/><text x=\"114\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">running total</text><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"346\" y2=\"196\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"58\" y=\"201\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"129\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.50</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"57\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"end\">1.00</text><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"66.4\" x2=\"346\" y2=\"66.4\" class=\"s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"58\" y=\"73.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">0.90</text><rect x=\"79\" y=\"138.4\" width=\"30\" height=\"57.6\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"134.5\" y=\"152.8\" width=\"30\" height=\"43.2\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"190\" y=\"174.4\" width=\"30\" height=\"21.6\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"245.5\" y=\"181.6\" width=\"30\" height=\"14.4\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"301\" y=\"188.8\" width=\"30\" height=\"7.2\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M94 138.4 L149.5 95.2 L205 73.6 L260.5 59.2 L316 52\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"138.4\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"f-ink\"/><circle cx=\"149.5\" cy=\"95.2\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"f-ink\"/><circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"73.6\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"f-ink\"/><circle cx=\"260.5\" cy=\"59.2\" r=\"7\" class=\"f-ok\"/><circle cx=\"316\" cy=\"52\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"f-ink\"/><text x=\"94\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PC1</text><text x=\"149.5\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PC2</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PC3</text><text x=\"260.5\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PC4</text><text x=\"316\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PC5</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">share</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.40</text><text x=\"149.5\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.30</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.15</text><text x=\"260.5\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.10</text><text x=\"316\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.05</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">total</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.40</text><text x=\"149.5\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.70</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.85</text><text x=\"260.5\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0.95</text><text x=\"316\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.00</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">index</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"149.5\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"260.5\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"316\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"304\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">First total of 0.90 or more: index 3.</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"324\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">Python counts from 0, so 3 + 1 = 4 columns.</text></svg>"
